<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight stocks rose, seven fell and and six were flat in 20.8-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 1.9 percent to 157 zlotys in an 18.2-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
